\" }], explanation: \"blossom = 花 → 开花，发展\" },\n    logic: { premise: \"花蕾经过孕育\", feature: \"在适宜条件下绽放\", result: \"展现美丽或取得发展\", essence: \"绽放，蓬勃发展\" },\n    usage: [{ context: \"开花\", example: \"cherry blossoms\", explanation: \"樱花\" }, { context: \"发展\", example: \"their friendship blossomed\", explanation: \"他们的友谊开花结果\" }],\n    distinction: [{ word: \"bloom\", essence: \"开花（单朵花）\" }, { word: \"flourish\", essence: \"繁荣\" }, { word: \"blossom\", essence: \"绽放/发展（果树开花，偏诗意）\" }],\n    memory: { methods: [\"blossom 听起来像'不冷'→ 不冷了就开花\", \"cherry blossom = 樱花\"], visualHint: \"春天满树盛开的樱花\" },\n    pitfalls: [\"blossom 可作名词（花）和动词（开花/发展）\", \"blossom into = 发展成\"],\n    summary: \"blossom = 开花，蓬勃发展\"\n  },\n  {\n    word: \"staple\",\n    phonetic: { uk: \"/ˈsteɪpl/\", us: \"/ˈsteɪpl/\" },\n    root: { components: [{ part: \"stap\", meaning: \"固定的桩\", origin: \"古英语 stapol（柱子）\" }, { part: \"-le\", meaning: \"名词后缀\", origin: \"\" }], explanation: \"staple = 固定不变的东西 → 主食，主要产品\" },\n    logic: { premise: \"某些物品是日常必需品\", feature: \"作为基础长期存在\", result: \"成为不可或缺的基础\", essence: \"基础性的，不可或缺的\" },\n    usage: [{ context: \"主食\", example: \"rice is a staple food\", explanation: \"大米是主食\" }, { context: \"主要产品\", example: \"the staple product\", explanation: \"主要产品\" }, { context: \"订书钉\", example: \"a stapler\", explanation: \"订书机\" }],\n    distinction: [{ word: \"essential\", essence: \"必要的\" }, { word: \"basic\", essence: \"基础的\" }, { word: \"staple\", essence: \"主要的/主食（日常基本需求）\" }],\n    memory: { methods: [\"staple 听起来像'死铁谱'→ 铁钉固定 → 主食（固定吃的）\", \"staple food = 主食\"], visualHint: \"亚洲人餐桌上的米饭\" },\n    pitfalls: [\"staple 有多个含义：主食、主要产品、订书钉\", \"staple 是可数名词\"],\n    summary: \"staple = 主食，主要产品，订书钉\"\n  },\n  {\n    word: \"manifestation\",\n    phonetic: { uk: \"/ˌmænɪfeˈsteɪʃn/\", us: \"/ˌmænɪfəˈsteɪʃn/\" },\n    root: { components: [{ part: \"mani\", meaning: \"手\", origin: \"拉丁语 manus\" }, { part: \"fest\", meaning: \"抓住\", origin: \"拉丁语 festus\" }, { part: \"-ation\", meaning: \"名词后缀\", origin: \"\" }], explanation: \"manifestation = 用手抓住使其可见 → 表现，显现\" },\n    logic: { premise: \"某种抽象力量或情感存在\", feature: \"通过具体形式展现出来\", result: \"成为可见可感的表达\", essence: \"抽象事物的具体表现\" },\n    usage: [{ context: \"表现\", example: \"a manifestation of anxiety\", explanation: \"焦虑的表现\" }, { context: \"显现\", example: \"the manifestation of the disease\", explanation: \"疾病的显现\" }],\n    distinction: [{ word: \"expression\", essence: \"表达\" }, { word: \"symptom\", essence: \"症状\" }, { word: \"manifestation\", essence: \"表现/显现（抽象→具体）\" }],\n    memory: { methods: [\"manifest（明显的）+ ation = 使明显的过程 → 表现\", \"联想：manifesto 宣言\"], visualHint: \"乌云密布是暴风雨来临的表现\" },\n    pitfalls: [\"manifestation 强调'从隐藏到显现'\", \"manifestation of = ...的表现\"],\n    summary: \"manifestation = 表现，显现\"\n  },\n  {\n    word: \"unsympathetic\",\n    phonetic: { uk: \"/ˌʌnˌsɪmpəˈθetɪk/\", us: \"/ˌʌnˌsɪmpəˈθetɪk/\" },\n    root: { components: [{ part: \"un-\", meaning: \"不\", origin: \"\" }, { part: \"sym\", meaning: \"共同\", origin: \"希腊语 syn\" }, { part: \"path\", meaning: \"感受\", origin: \"希腊语 pathos\" }, { part: \"-etic\", meaning: \"形容词后缀\", origin: \"\" }], explanation: \"unsympathetic = 没有共同感受的 → 不同情的，冷漠的\" },\n    logic: { premise: \"他人遭受困境\", feature: \"无法与之共情\", result: \"表现出冷漠或不关心\", essence: \"缺乏同情心的\" },\n    usage: [{ context: \"不同情的\", example: \"unsympathetic response\", explanation: \"冷漠的回应\" }, { context: \"不赞同的\", example: \"unsympathetic to the proposal\", explanation: \"不赞同该提案\" }],\n    distinction: [{ word: \"cold\", essence: \"冷淡的\" }, { word: \"indifferent\", essence: \"漠不关心的\" }, { word: \"unsympathetic\", essence: \"不同情的（主动缺乏共情）\" }],\n    memory: { methods: [\"un + sympathetic（同情的）= 不同情的\", \"联想：sympathy 同情，empathy 共情\"], visualHint: \"一个人转身不看求助者\" },\n    pitfalls: [\"unsympathetic to = 对...不赞同/不同情\", \"unsympathetic ≠ unsympathetic（拼写确认）\"],\n    summary: \"unsympathetic = 不同情的，冷漠的\"\n  },\n  {\n    word: \"plague\",\n    phonetic: { uk: \"/pleɪɡ/\", us: \"/pleɪɡ/\" },\n    root: { components: [{ part: \"plague\", meaning: \"瘟疫，祸患\", origin: \"拉丁语 plaga（打击）\" }], explanation: \"plague = 神的打击 → 瘟疫，祸患\" },\n    logic: { premise: \"某种灾难大规模蔓延\", feature: \"像瘟疫一样传播和伤害\", result: \"造成广泛痛苦\", essence: \"大规模的灾害和痛苦\" },\n    usage: [{ context: \"瘟疫\", example: \"the bubonic plague\", explanation: \"黑死病\" }, { context: \"祸患\", example: \"a plague of locusts\", explanation: \"蝗灾\" }, { context: \"困扰\", example: \"plagued by doubts\", explanation: \"被疑虑困扰\" }],\n    distinction: [{ word: \"epidemic\", essence: \"流行病（中性）\" }, { word: \"disaster\", essence: \"灾难（通用）\" }, { word: \"plague\", essence: \"瘟疫/祸患（带有灾难性和持续性）\" }],\n    memory: { methods: [\"plague 听起来像'扑雷格'→ 扑灭雷一样可怕的瘟疫\", \"avoid like the plague = 像避瘟疫一样避开\"], visualHint: \"中世纪黑死病的可怕场景\" },\n    pitfalls: [\"plague 可作动词：be plagued by\", \"avoid like the plague 是常见习语\"],\n    summary: \"plague = 瘟疫，祸患，困扰\"\n  },\n  {\n    word: \"pore\",\n    phonetic: { uk: \"/pɔː(r)/\", us: \"/pɔːr/\" },\n    root: { components: [{ part: \"pore\", meaning: \"毛孔，细孔\", origin: \"中古英语 pore\" }], explanation: \"pore = 皮肤上的小孔 → 毛孔，细孔\" },\n    logic: { premise: \"皮肤或物质表面有微小开口\", feature: \"液体或气体可通过\", result: \"形成渗透或排汗通道\", essence: \"表面的微小开口\" },\n    usage: [{ context: \"毛孔\", example: \"clogged pores\", explanation: \"堵塞的毛孔\" }, { context: \"细孔\", example: \"pores in the rock\", explanation: \"岩石中的细孔\" }, { context: \"钻研\", example: \"pore over books\", explanation: \"埋头苦读\" }],\n    distinction: [{ word: \"hole\", essence: \"洞（通用）\" }, { word: \"opening\", essence: \"开口\" }, { word: \"pore\", essence: \"毛孔/细孔（微观）\" }],\n    memory: { methods: [\"pore over = 钻研/仔细阅读\", \"pore 作为毛孔与 pour（倒）发音相同但拼写不同\"], visualHint: \"放大镜下的皮肤毛孔\" },\n    pitfalls: [\"pore over ≠ pour over（钻研 ≠ 倾倒）\", \"pore 作'钻研'时是不及物动词，需加 over\"],\n    summary: \"pore = 毛孔，细孔；钻研\"\n  },\n  {\n    word: \"prolific\",\n    phonetic: { uk: \"/prəˈlɪfɪk/\", us: \"/prəˈlɪfɪk/\" },\n    root: { components: [{ part: \"prol(i)\", meaning: \"后代，繁殖\", origin: \"拉丁语 proles（后代）\" }, { part: \"-fic\", meaning: \"做，产生\", origin: \"拉丁语 facere\" }], explanation: \"prolific = 产生大量后代的 → 多产的，丰富的\" },\n    logic: { premise: \"某人或某物有极强的产出能力\", feature: \"持续大量地生产\", result: \"作品或成果极为丰富\", essence: \"多产的，丰饶的\" },\n    usage: [{ context: \"多产的\", example: \"a prolific writer\", explanation: \"多产的作家\" }, { context: \"丰富的\", example: \"prolific output\", explanation: \"丰富的产出\" }],\n    distinction: [{ word: \"productive\", essence: \"高效的\" }, { word: \"abundant\", essence: \"丰富的\" }, { word: \"prolific\", essence: \"多产的（强调数量多）\" }],\n    memory: { methods: [\"proli（后代）+ fic（产生）= 产生大量后代 → 多产的\", \"联想：proliferation 扩散\"], visualHint: \"书架上摆满了同一位作家的几十本书\" },\n    pitfalls: [\"prolific 强调'数量'而非'质量'\", \"prolific 可用于艺术家、动植物等\"],\n    summary: \"prolific = 多产的，丰富的\"\n  },\n  {\n    word: \"utterance\",\n    phonetic: { uk: \"/ˈʌtərəns/\", us: \"/ˈʌtərəns/\" },\n    root: { components: [{ part: \"utter\", meaning: \"发出，说出\", origin: \"古英语 ūtian（向外）\" }, { part: \"-ance\", meaning: \"名词后缀\", origin: \"\" }], explanation: \"utterance = 向外发出的声音 → 话语，言论\" },\n    logic: { premise: \"某人想要表达想法\", feature: \"通过发声将其表达出来\", result: \"形成一段话语或言论\", essence: \"说出的话或言论\" },\n    usage: [{ context: \"话语\", example: \"his last utterance\", explanation: \"他的遗言\" }, { context: \"言论\", example: \"political utterances\", explanation: \"政治言论\" }],\n    distinction: [{ word: \"speech\", essence: \"演讲\" }, { word: \"statement\", essence: \"声明\" }, { word: \"utterance\", essence: \"话语（偏语言学，强调发声行为）\" }],\n    memory: { methods: [\"utter（说出）+ ance = 说出的行为 → 话语\", \"联想：utter = 完全的/说出\"], visualHint: \"一个人张嘴说出重要的话\" },\n    pitfalls: [\"utterance 是语言学专业术语\", \"utterance 可指一句话或一段话\"],\n    summary: \"utterance = 话语，言论\"\n  },\n  {\n    word: \"tremendous\",\n    phonetic: { uk: \"/trɪˈmendəs/\", us: \"/trəˈmendəs/\" },\n    root: { components: [{ part: \"trem\", meaning: \"颤抖\", origin: \"拉丁语 tremere\" }, { part: \"-end\", meaning: \"值得...的\", origin: \"\" }